    (1132::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'The door begins around 01:00, and arriving much earlier only creates dead time. Tuesday''s Hype crowd and peak weekends can build quickly; table promises should be confirmed in writing. Reviews also report bag theft, so keep your phone on-body through entry, cloakroom and floor.',
      'best_nights', 'Tuesday''s independent Hype party is the sharper choice for hip-hop, trap, afrobeats, EDM and an international-local mix. Wednesday through Saturday lean pop, reggaetón and broader dance across two rooms. Let the named party decide; the same building can feel radically different overnight.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Students, young porteños, exchange visitors and travellers fill the rooms, with queer guests welcome but no evidence that ordinary nights are LGBTQ+-centred. Hype is notably international; weekends are more mainstream Palermo. Come for mixed-night energy, not a guaranteed queer-majority floor.',
      'dress_code', 'Smart-casual Palermo clubwear is the safest fit: trainers in good condition, a clean going-out look and a compact bag. No precise official ban list is published. The bigger issue is belongings—zipped pockets and an on-body phone matter because multiple guests describe opened bags or missing devices.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Friendly bartenders and fast service appear beside serious complaints about security, reserved-table handling and treatment of foreign guests. A large visible security team is not the same as consistent care. Confirm charges, photograph any table agreement and escalate lost-property concerns immediately.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_large_mainstream_palermo_nightclub_at_honduras_5339_with_two_rooms_tuesday_hype_hiphop_trap_afrobeats_international_mix_and_midweek_weekend_pop_reggaeton_programming_plus_material_security_service_complaints',
      'identity_note', 'Kika remains listed and inspected at Honduras 5339. It is a mainstream mixed nightclub, not a dedicated queer venue; nightly formats and promoters vary.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.kikaclub.com.ar/','https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g312741-d2155732-Reviews-Hype-Buenos_Aires_Capital_Federal_District.html','https://www.tripadvisor.co/Attraction_Review-g312741-d2486896-Reviews-Kika_Club-Buenos_Aires_Capital_Federal_District.html','https://restaurantguru.com/CHEKA-Buenos-Aires','https://www.agcba.gob.ar/docs/inf-20250312_2405---AGC-FISCALIZACION-Y-CONTROL-DE-LOCALES-BAILABLES-CLASE-C..pdf']::text[]),
      'topic_evidence', jsonb_build_object(
