    (417::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'This is a café, so the pressure is table and kitchen time rather than a velvet rope. The new Avenida de Mayo room is quiet early, while lunch, weekend events and the historic-centre flow can slow orders. Recent reviews mention 45-minute mistakes; check in politely if your table stalls.',
      'best_nights', 'Come by day for coffee, brunch or a pause near Plaza de Mayo; Friday and Saturday extend later for cocktails and events. Drag, art, acoustic music and fetish-themed dates change the tone, so use the current calendar. The daytime visibility remains the point, not simply late drinking.',
      'crowd_mix', 'LGBTQ+ locals, couples, friends, remote workers and international visitors share a deliberately integrated room. Its history as the city''s first daytime LGBTIQ+ café still matters. Tourists are common in the historic centre, but the place works best as a neighbourhood meeting point, not a themed attraction.',
      'dress_code', 'Coffee clothes, workday layers, leather accents for a themed event or a polished evening look can all belong. There is no everyday dress test. Check event wording when fetish programming appears, and never read someone''s outfit as consent outside or inside that specific night.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Many guests describe a safe, cordial, all-community welcome and staff happy to host solo visitors. Recent feedback is more mixed on speed, forgotten orders and one serious discrimination complaint. Warm branding needs accountable service; raise problems directly and keep the receipt.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_historic_daytime_lgbtiq_cafe_now_at_avenida_de_mayo_714_with_coffee_brunch_cocktails_drag_art_music_and_occasional_fetish_events_mixed_local_visitor_crowd_and_recent_service_consistency_concerns',
      'identity_note', 'Pride Café moved from Balcarce 869 to Avenida de Mayo 714 by January 2026. The stored Lobos location and HomoSapiens link are incorrect and must not be used for navigation or identity.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.instagram.com/cafepride/','https://buenosaires.gob.ar/gcaba_historico/pride-cafe','https://holasantelmo.ar/pride-cafe/','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/1521329/pride-cafe','https://es.restaurantguru.com/PRIDE-CAFE-Buenos-Aires','https://www.timeout.com/buenos-aires/proposals-for-the-lgbtiq-community-in-buenos-aires']::text[]),
