    (836::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'This small, family-run hotel has a 24-hour desk rather than a lobby queue. Guests repeatedly praise flexible bag drops, early arrivals and practical help; peak check-in can still be one conversation at a time. Message ahead if timing matters, especially while nearby construction affects room assignment.',
      'best_nights', 'Stay here when Palermo Soho itself is the plan: cafés, restaurants, bars and Plaza Serrano are minutes away, yet the street settles enough for sleep. Weekends maximise doorstep nightlife; weekdays show the calmer boutique side. Breakfast and host recommendations make the morning as useful as the night.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Solo travellers, couples and international city-break guests dominate a quiet boutique setting. It is listed as gay-friendly, not queer-exclusive, and its intimate scale feels more personal than scene-driven. The surrounding Palermo crowd supplies the nightlife; the hotel remains a restful base.',
      'dress_code', 'There is no dress code beyond ordinary hotel respect. Streetwear, dinner clothes and Pride-weekend looks pass through the same blue doorway. Pack for Palermo''s walking rhythm and ask about the accessible room if needed; some bathrooms and mattresses draw individual fit notes in otherwise strong reviews.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Staff are the standout: verified guests call the family caring, funny, flexible and excellent with neighbourhood advice. No review set proves every LGBTQ+ experience, but same-sex couples should expect a professional mixed hotel rather than a coded “gay hotel.” Report any mismatch directly to the hands-on hosts.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_small_family_run_palermo_soho_boutique_hotel_at_malabia_1565_with_quiet_central_location_continental_breakfast_accessible_room_mixed_international_couples_and_solo_guests_and_exceptional_host_consensus',
      'identity_note', 'Sissi Haz Hotel is active at Malabia 1565, not the stored 1561. It is a broadly welcoming boutique hotel in Palermo Soho, not an LGBTQ+-exclusive property.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://sissihaz.com.ar/','https://www.booking.com/hotel/ar/sissi-haz-boutique.en-gb.html','https://www.booking.com/reviews/ar/hotel/sissi-haz-boutique.en-gb.html']::text[]),
