    (1775::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'The 24-hour Seomyeon desk is usually efficient, though tour groups and breakfast departures can bunch the lifts and lobby. Leave bags if your room is not ready and confirm parking access before driving into the nightlife lanes. The hotel entrance sits above one of Busan''s busiest evening grids.',
      'best_nights', 'Choose Arban for city movement rather than a resort night: Friday-Saturday put Seomyeon food, bars and late shopping outside; weekdays make Line 1 and Line 2 transfers effortless. The sky lounge and breakfast are useful reset spaces after the district has kept you out late.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Korean weekenders, couples, families, business travellers and international sightseers make a broad urban-hotel mix. This is not a queer property, but it gives discreet access to Seomyeon and a short ride to Beomil''s gay bars. Expect normal hotel privacy, not an LGBTQ+ social scene.',
      'dress_code', 'Anything from tourist layers to sharp dinner clothes fits. There is no dress code beyond shared-hotel etiquette. Rooms are often praised as spacious, so the real packing choice is footwear for Seomyeon; keep a modest layer for breakfast and public lifts after a late night.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Guests consistently mention welcoming staff, clean large rooms and strong value. English support can vary by shift, as in many independent Korean hotels, but the service pattern is positive. Same-sex couples should book the room they want without needing to explain their relationship.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_central_seomyeon_business_and_leisure_hotel_at_32_jungang_daero_691beon_gil_with_spacious_clean_room_consensus_sky_lounge_breakfast_transit_nightlife_access_and_mixed_mainstream_guest_profile',
      'identity_note', 'Arban Hotel is active at 32 Jungang-daero 691beon-gil in Seomyeon. It is a mainstream hotel with convenient indirect access to Busan''s queer nightlife, not an LGBTQ+-exclusive property.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.arbanhotel.com/','https://en.arbanhotel.com/WELCOME','https://www.booking.com/hotel/kr/arban.en-gb.html','https://www.booking.com/hotel/kr/arban.html']::text[]),
