    (1764::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'There is rarely a formal queue at this small men-only karaoke bar. Beomil-dong can look closed before 20:00, and BLUE''s discreet frontage is easy to miss; Friday-Saturday seats fill later. Save the Korean name or map pin and be prepared to ask nearby bar staff for the exact doorway.',
      'best_nights', 'Friday and Saturday offer the liveliest singing and easiest chance to follow a group into a chorus. A weekday is quieter and more host-led, useful if your Korean is stronger. This is Korean-style gay karaoke, not a Western open-mic bar, so the room''s social ritual matters as much as song choice.',
      'crowd_mix', 'The venue is described as men-only, local and friendly, with few casual tourists and limited English. Expect regulars who know one another, older Korean favourites beside pop and a more private tone than a dance club. It is not suitable for queer women or mixed-gender groups.',
      'dress_code', 'Neat casual clothes are enough: clean trainers, jeans and a bar-ready shirt. There is no fetish or fashion code reported. In this intimate room, good manners carry more weight—wait your turn, read the host''s cues and never photograph singers or guests without explicit permission.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'The crowd is reported as warm, but language is the main access barrier and staff may speak little English. A translation app and respectful Korean greeting go further than entitlement. Confirm prices before ordering; some neighbourhood karaoke venues expect drinks plus substantial side dishes.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_but_low_verification_men_only_gay_karaoke_bar_in_beomil_dong_with_discreet_frontage_local_regular_crowd_late_weekend_singing_limited_english_neat_casual_norm_and_possible_korean_karaoke_side_dish_pricing',
      'identity_note', 'BLUE is consistently listed as a men-only gay karaoke bar in Beomil-dong, but no precise current street number or operator channel is published. The record should retain a verification caution and not promise effortless navigation.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.travelgay.com/venue/blue','https://stg.travelgay.com/busan-gay-bars','https://www.utopia-asia.com/pusbars.htm','https://queerintheworld.com/gay-busan-south-korea-travel-guide/','https://www.gay-location.com/busan/bars-cafes/blue.html']::text[]),
      'topic_evidence', jsonb_build_object(
        'queue_wait', jsonb_build_object('status','small_no_formal_queue_discreet_frontage_pre_2000_apparent_closure_and_later_weekend_seat_pressure','source_urls',to_jsonb(array['https://www.travelgay.com/venue/blue','https://www.utopia-asia.com/pusbars.htm']::text[]),'checked_at','2026-08-07T00:00:00Z'),
